  {
    "hotel_id": "178263",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/prime-hotel-nha-trang/hotel/nha-trang-vn.html",
    "name": "Prime New",
    "detail": "We stayed in a standard room, the window for the standard is skinny and on the one side of the room but you can still have a sea view even while in bed and to have a window from floor to ceiling in a standard room for this price is great! The room was very nice and very comfortable. We ordered room service a couple of times and were very pleased with the good food that came, very pleased. The service was great and the buffet breakfast was the best we have found in 7 months of travelling. You can custom order food or from the buffet and the food is fresh and very tasty. Lots of fruit is put out also.....seems to be rare for a lot of places to do to this extent. The walk to the beach is very short.....not half a block and you are on a beautifully maintained park that runs along their coastline for a long ways. The city of Nha Trang is definately a gem that many people have yet to really hear about. The tourism is definately here and has effected the people in that they are a little more aggressively selling but it is a very beautiful place. The hotel has a roof top pool that has a spectacular view of the sea and the city that we enjoyed both in the pool and out of just to sit and relax. Beautiful....looks even better than the pictures. This hotel is one of good value that if I were to return to Nha Trang it is most likely where we will stay again. ",
    "area": "Loc Tho,Nha Trang - View on map",
